WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:06.090
(machine sounds)

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:11.090
(haunting chimes)

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.200
(machine sounds)

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:21.740
(haunting chimes)

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.710
(computer beeps and clicks)

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:27.520
- Fireteam Osiris, over the last 72 hours

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.290
5 colonies have experienced
identical events-

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:34.790
massive destruction, Forerunner in origin.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:36.290
A Doctor Catherine Elizabeth Halsey

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:38.390
has managed to contact us.

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:42.330
She claims to have
information on these attacks.

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:43.930
- Halsey is currently in Covenant custody

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:45.700
on the surface of Kamchada.

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.670
Your mission is to insert
behind enemy lines,

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:51.070
retrieve Halsey and bring
her back to Infinity.

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.040
Be advised, Dr. Halsey is accompanied

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.840
by Covenant Supreme Leader Jul 'Mdama.

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:57.450
If you have the opportunity-

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:59.050
- Understood Commander.

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:00.750
- Good luck, Spartan Locke.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:01.370
Infinity out.

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:02.480
- Tracking gear online.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:04.390
- Affirmative.

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:06.154
- Say, before we make this jump,

00:01:06.154 --> 00:01:08.490
anybody want to say a few words?

00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:10.630
- I figure if God can hear how scared I am

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:13.360
so can everyone else.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:16.000
Locke, you buying first
drink when we're done?

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.370
- You ask, you buy.

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:20.300
(laughs)

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:23.670
- Fireteam Osiris, the light is green.

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:28.190
(buzzer and machine sounds)

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:33.190
(triumphant music)

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:45.470
(fanfare of trumpets)

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:55.540
(triumphant music)

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:58.840
- [Locke] Com check.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:00.480
- [Tanaka] Coms working fine, boss.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:01.810
- [Locke] Copy that, Tanaka.

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:03.680
- [Buck] Spartan Buck online and ready.

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:05.180
- [Vale] Spartan Vale online.

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:09.790
- [Locke] Weapons free.

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:10.820
- [Buck] Contact.

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:16.880
(gun shots)

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:22.260
(crashes and booms)

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:27.600
(gun shots and machine sounds)

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:40.580
(screams)

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:45.580
(gun shots and fighting sounds)

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:03.140
- [Vale] Heads up.

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:04.970
- [Locke] Let's bounce.

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:12.350
(gun shots)

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:18.250
(triumphant music)

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:23.190
(chime)

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:25.934
- [Voiceover] Get the Xbox
One Limited Edition Bundle.

